<Layout title="Home">
	<h1>Decision Authority Layer (DAL)</h1>
	<p class="hero">The Decision Authority Layer (DAL) is a governance-layer specification for explicitly declaring and auditing decision authority in systems that include automated agents.</p>
	
	<p>As automated and AI-driven systems increasingly participate in decision-making, accountability becomes difficult to establish when authority to act is not formally declared. DAL addresses this structural gap by specifying how decision authority can be made explicit, bounded, and auditable.</p>

	<div class="disclaimer">
		<strong>Authoritative specification:</strong><br>
		The DAL specification is published and maintained at its canonical location on GitHub. This website provides context only and is not the specification.
	</div>

	<p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
		<a href="https://blockchaination.github.io/decision-authority-layer/spec/" style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: bold;">Read the DAL v0.1 Specification &rarr;</a>
	</p>
</Layout>

